# C2: mlmf-source-file's direct dependencies. Changing this file is a
# deliberate act. Keep sorted -- `deps.rs::direct_dependencies_match_allowlist`
# compares against the manifest's sorted dependency list with `assert_eq!`
# over a VECTOR, not a set, so an entry in the wrong position fails exactly
# as a missing one does.
#
# One entry, and spec §3.1 is why it is the only one this crate may ever
# have on the format side: "sources depend on mlmf-core only, never on a
# format crate". An edge to mlmf-gguf or mlmf-safetensors here would make
# this source usable with one format, which is the composition the two-axis
# design exists to avoid needing.
mlmf-core
